      "mainText": "Technology Made Simple.\n\nTechSmart Learning for Seniors is a non-profit organization committed to teaching older adults the latest tools and technology to help them lead active lives.\n\nI Need Technology Help\nI Want to Help\nHow Can We Help?\nFind a Workshop\n\nFind technology workshops and learning opportunities near you.\n\nFind Workshops\nTechnology Resources\n\nExplore simple technology guides and educational resources.\n\nView Resources\nGet Technology Help\n\nFind support when you need help using everyday technology.\n\nGet Help\nFind a Workshop Near You\n\nEnter your ZIP code to find technology workshops in your area.\n\n​\n\nExample: 30301\n\nFind Workshops\nWant to Make a Difference?\n\nHelp TechSmart support older adults as they learn to use technology.\n\nDonate\nVolunteer\nAdvocate",
