      "mainText": "I Want to Help\n\nYour support helps TechSmart provide technology education and resources for older adults.\n\nMaking an Impact Together\n\nSince 2012, TechSmart Learning for Seniors has educated more than 7,000 older adults across metro Atlanta.\n\nThrough technology education, volunteers, donations, and community partnerships, TechSmart helps older adults build digital skills, gain confidence, and stay connected.\n\n7,000+\n\nOlder adults educated since 2012\n\nTechnology Education\n\nHelping older adults learn everyday digital skills.\n\nStronger Communities\n\nSupporting confidence, independence, and connection through technology.\n\nAI-generated illustrations of senior technology learning.\nHow Would You Like to Help?\n\nDonate, volunteer your time, or learn how you can advocate for technology education.\n\nDonate\n\nSupport technology education and learning opportunities for older adults.\n\nDonate\nVolunteer\n\nShare your time and skills by helping older adults become more confident with technology.\n\nRegister with Hands on Atlanta\nAdvocate\n\nLearn about TechSmart's community impact and help spread awareness about technology education for older adults.\n\nLearn About Our Impact\nOur Community Partners & Supporters\n\nTechSmart Learning for Seniors is grateful for the organizations and individuals who support technology education for older adults.\n\nThrough financial contributions, volunteer time, and community resources, our supporters help older adults build digital skills, confidence, and meaningful connections.\n\nWaymo\n\n$5,000 and Above\n\nInsight Global\n\n$5,000 and Above\n\nCumberland Group\n\n$5,000 and Above\n\nHiller\n\n$5,000 and Above\n\nDelta Community Credit Union\n\n$2,500 and Above",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Register with Hands on Atlanta",
          "href": "https://volunteer.handsonatlanta.org/"
        },
        {
          "text": "Learn About Our Impact",
          "href": "#community-impact"
        }
      ],
